367
00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.700
into my anaerobic system at the snap of a finger

368
00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.710
when I hit this exertion level."

369
00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:40.370
And the idea is to push that exertion level

370
00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.270
as far to the right as possible

371
00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:47.070
so that that switch from one energy system to the next

